['```javascript
function copyBytes(dataChunks, startOffset, length) {
  const copiedData = Buffer.allocUnsafe(length);
  let offset = 0;
  for (const chunk of dataChunks) {
    if (offset >= length) break;
    const bytesToCopy = Math.min(chunk.length - startOffset, length - offset);
    chunk.copy(copiedData, offset, startOffset, startOffset + bytesToCopy);
    offset += bytesToCopy;
    startOffset = 0;
  }
  return copiedData;
}
```


**Note:** This code snippet addresses only the specific task of copying bytes from buffered data chunks. The larger API gateway design and implementation require a more extensive approach involving various technologies, frameworks, and configurations as outlined in your initial prompt.



